Subject: [PATCH 71/97] recoverssm: share RecoverSSM commit kernels and helpers
 across models (port of upstream #58863, a80e41d690)

Port of the upstream vLLM change #58863 (Apache-2.0). The commit-plan and conv-window compaction kernels move from the Kimi-K3 model
into model_executor/layers/mamba/ops/recoverssm.py with shared helpers; kernel source unchanged.
